[I] Library to simplify the drawing of beautiful curves

[T] LibSpiro is a shared library giving programs the ability to create
[T] smooth continuous curves based on a set of codes and X,Y constraints,
[T] translated into Bezier curves. It is based on Raph Levien's Spiro work
[T] and used by font editors like FontForge and drawing programs such as
[T] GEGL and Ipe.

[U] https://github.com/fontforge/libspiro

[A] Libspiro Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

